  "rawText": "Item Class: Body Armours
Rarity: Unique
Forgotten Warden
Primal Markings
--------
Quality: +20% (augmented)
Evasion Rating: 1187 (augmented)
Energy Shield: 363 (augmented)
--------
Requires: Level 78, 67 Dex, 67 Int
--------
Sockets: S S
--------
Item Level: 81
--------
{ Corruption Enhancement — Life }
+39(30-40) to maximum Life
--------
12% increased Rarity of Items found (rune)
10% increased Deflection Rating (rune)
--------
Grants Skill: Level 18 Spirit Vessel
--------
{ Unique Modifier — Evasion }
+97(70-100) to Deflection Rating per 50 missing Energy Shield
{ Unique Modifier — Evasion, Energy Shield }
269(200-300)% increased Evasion and Energy Shield
{ Unique Modifier — Attribute }
+25(20-30) to Dexterity
{ Unique Modifier — Life, Minion }
Companions have 35(30-50)% increased maximum Life
{ Unique Modifier }
15(10-15)% of Damage from Deflected Hits is taken from Damageable Companion's Life before you
--------
A gift from the Draíocht, lost in Darkness.
The bronze hums. The cloth sighs.
Living pieces of her, yearning to exist.
--------
Corrupted
